  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dairy sector improvement Georgia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A study visit has been organised for dairy farmers and governmental officials in Georgia, to learn about the Dutch experiences and knowledge in the dairy sector.The main objective of this mission is to address the challenges and problems faced by the Georgian dairy sector, while aligning with the goals of the Agricultural Sector Strategy of Georgia.The Netherlands embassy in Tbilisi, Georgia believes that these goals are essential for the future development of the dairy sector of Georgia, which includes enhancing the competitiveness of entrepreneurs and farmers, institutional development of the sector, development of the value chain, development of the regional and agricultural infrastructure, and ensuring food security.</narrative>
  </description>
